  <div class="docs-callout docs-callout-info">
    <strong>📡 Multi-Messenger Single Source of Truth Architecture:</strong><br />
    All messenger bots (<strong>Telegram</strong>, <strong>Discord</strong>, and <strong>Signal</strong>) share the unified <code>agent_station_core</code> engine. Every single feature—autonomous coding agent loops (<code>/task</code>), smart AI router querying (<code>/chat</code>, <code>/gemini</code>, <code>/gpt4</code>), GitHub auto-cloning (<code>/clone</code>, <code>/newrepo</code>), git branches/diffs, Obsidian notes (<code>/note</code>, <code>/vault</code>), and user-defined dynamic shortcuts (<code>/addcmd</code>)—works identically across every messenger!
  </div>

